    "text": "<p>CFSE for octahedral complex <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>eg</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#160;As&#160;</mtext><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>87</mn><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi><mtext>&#160;so number unpaired electron&#160;</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Metal ion</td>\t\t\t<td>configuration</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CFSE</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><msup><mi>Co</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mn>7</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CFSE</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>o</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\